WEBVTT

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.100
Another one.

00:01:04.603 --> 00:01:06.603
It's louder today.

00:01:13.175 --> 00:01:15.395
Nothing is louder here.

00:01:15.495 --> 00:01:17.895
Not for twenty years.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:23.267
Then why can I still hear it?

00:02:17.267 --> 00:02:19.267
People of Corrow.

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:21.967
The Chord is dying.

00:02:23.017 --> 00:02:25.467
We keep what is left.

00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:29.958
At dawn, Corrow will be quieted.

00:02:48.008 --> 00:02:49.208
Quieted.

00:02:49.468 --> 00:02:51.008
What does that even mean?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.480
It means gone.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.070
No ship in.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.740
No ship out.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:58.800
Ever.

00:02:59.332 --> 00:03:01.592
They can't close a whole world.

00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:04.483
They closed your mother's.

00:03:14.535 --> 00:03:15.667
Then we leave tonight.

00:03:37.264 --> 00:03:39.134
You built a ship.

00:03:39.655 --> 00:03:41.175
Twenty years.

00:03:41.275 --> 00:03:44.075
One scrap at a time.

00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:51.017
She has never sung. Not once.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.300
Bram. It's coming from her.

00:04:53.485 --> 00:04:55.485
There you are.

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:58.567
She's a tuner's girl.

00:04:58.897 --> 00:05:00.897
She hears nothing.

00:05:02.959 --> 00:05:04.959
Everyone hears nothing here.

00:05:05.059 --> 00:05:07.459
That is the point.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.320
Little bird.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:14.550
There is no air left here to sing in.

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:16.642
I'll find you.
